Notebook[{
Cell["Lesson 05 - Propagator", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"e388dd97-f07c-44d1-89b0-ac5c62c5060f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Physics step.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Invert ",
 StyleBox["\[CapitalGamma]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "2 + R to get the propagator G(",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ", q), using the MSR block structure: the (",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") block vanishes by causality, so G has the retarded response G_{",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]\:0304\[CurlyPhi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "} = B(",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")",
 StyleBox["\:207b\.b9",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ", the advanced one, and the correlation G_{",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]\[CurlyPhi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "} = ",
 StyleBox["\[Minus]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "(B(",
 StyleBox["\[Minus]\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")",
 StyleBox["\:1d40",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")",
 StyleBox["\:207b\.b9",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " C B(",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")",
 StyleBox["\:207b\.b9",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ", with B the (",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["\[CurlyPhi]\:0304",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") block and C the noise block. The poles are the roots of ",
 StyleBox["\[CapitalDelta]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") = det B(",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "); the module states the conditions for them to be causal."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c6bbd4c0-c7ec-4eae-8e26-5560b046d49a"],

